                        <h2><span style="font-size: 24px;"><em>farmplanning.uada.edu</em></span></h2>
                        
                        <p>A website for estimating costs of production for Arkansas producers via a budget web
                           application as well as a calculator for figuring irrigation costs is in production
                           and will be live as soon as possible.&nbsp;</p>
                        
